"Usage: mqtt_server [OPTIONS]\n\nOptions:\n      --uauthority <UAUTHORITY>  Authority for the local service identity [default: authority-a]\n      --uentity <UENTITY>        UEntity ID for local service identity (decimal or 0x-prefixed hex) [default: 0x4321]\n      --uversion <UVERSION>      UEntity major version for local service identity (decimal or 0x-prefixed hex) [default: 0x1]\n      --resource <RESOURCE>      Resource ID for local service identity (decimal or 0x-prefixed hex) [default: 0x0421]\n      --broker-uri <BROKER_URI>  MQTT broker URI in host:port format [default: localhost:1883]\n  -h, --help                     Print help\n  -V, --version                  Print version\n"
